sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as Payer / Cardholder
    actor Merchant as Merchant Web/Mobile App
    participant Vault as PCI Token Vault
    participant Gateway as Payment Gateway
    participant DS as 3DS Directory Server
    participant ACS as Issuer Access Control Server
    participant Acquirer as Card Acquirer / Scheme
    participant Ledger as Double-Entry Ledger

    Merchant->>Gateway: POST /v1/payment_intents {amount: $250.00, currency: USD}
    Gateway-->>Merchant: PaymentIntent Created {client_secret: "pi_sec_891"}

    Customer->>Vault: Submit Card Details (PAN, CVV, Exp) via Hosted Fields
    Vault-->>Customer: Return Ephemeral Token ("tok_vault_901")

    Customer->>Gateway: POST /v1/payment_intents/{id}/confirm {token: "tok_vault_901"}
    Gateway->>DS: 3DS2 Authentication Request (AReq)

    alt Frictionless Flow (Low Risk)
        DS->>ACS: Evaluate Device / Transaction Profile
        ACS-->>DS: Authentication Response (ARes: transStatus = 'Y')
        DS-->>Gateway: Frictionless Approved (CAVV Cryptogram Generated)
    else Challenge Flow (Step-up Verification)
        DS-->>Gateway: ARes: transStatus = 'C' (Challenge Required)
        Gateway-->>Customer: Render ACS Challenge OTP Dialog
        Customer->>ACS: Submit OTP / Biometric Verification
        ACS-->>Gateway: Challenge Response (CRes: transStatus = 'Y')
    end

    Gateway->>Acquirer: ISO 8583 Authorization Request (0100) + CAVV
    Acquirer-->>Gateway: Authorization Approved (0110, AuthCode: "AUTH_7812")

    Gateway->>Ledger: BookHold(Debit: CardReceivable, Credit: MerchantPendingBalance)
    Gateway-->>Merchant: Webhook: payment_intent.succeeded
    Gateway-->>Customer: Checkout Complete (Redirect to Success URL)
